    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30732" root="عند" body-key="E">[
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِنْدِيَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>A saying</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِنْدِى</span>, meaning <i>In my opinion;
an assertion of mere opinion of one's own.</i> Hence
the phrase, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا مِنْ عِنْدِيَّاتِهِ</span> (occurring in the TA
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جرب</span>) <i>This is</i> one <i>of his assertions of
mere opinion.</i>]

